    },
    "body": "Proposal for the team's review — on hold, not for merge until reviewed. Contents, in one diff: a local preflight script mirroring the CI gate, a two-mode Gate C trend check (regression when the pin is untouched; re-pin self-consistency when a PR re-pins with an era note), AGENTS.md process-convention additions (per-worktree build isolation, PR watch discipline), and a path filter so the trend harness runs only when a scored-graph surface changed. Motivating measurements and incident history are recorded on #234/#243 and in the #293–#298 PR bodies.",
